==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þvá|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|þwahanan|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θvɔː/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɔː|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{head|is|verb|mixed conjugation||third person singular past indicative|þvoði|supine|þvegið|third person past subjunctive|þvægi}}

# to [[wash]], to [[do]] (laundry)
#: ''Að '''þvo''' [[þvottur|þvott]].''
#:: '''Doing''' [[laundry]].

====Usage notes====
* '''Þvo''' is the only verb in Icelandic which ends in an '''-o'''.

